       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI51202.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI51202.
      *
      *     Atribuir tarefa
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI51202         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7202 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5120.
       COPY SWCV5121.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7202 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7202'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME            PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI51202'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI51202         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5120-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5120-ASE       TO SWCV5121-ASE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5120-ADE       TO SWCV5121-ADE.



           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-OBTEM-DADOS
                 THRU 2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF

           .
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-OBTEM-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-OBTEM-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5120-MRNOPR
             TO SWCD7202-MRNOPR
           MOVE SWCV5120-MRNORD
             TO SWCD7202-MRNORD

           EXEC SQL
                 SELECT
                       MRBALC
                     , MRCCB
                     , NCCCCBAN
                     , NCCCCSPAI
                     , NCCCCCONTA
                     , MRTDOC
                     , MRCOPE
                     , MRNDOC
                     , MRVLR
                     , MRSALD
                     , MRUSER
                     , MRDTSIS
                     , MRHORA
                     , MRDATL
                     , MRDRCX
                     , MRETRB
                     , MRBALM
                     , MROBS
                     , MRNOPR
                     , MRNOPS
                     , MRNORD
                     , MREANL
                     , MRDTCB
                     , MREXCT
                     , MRMOED
                     , MRDMOV
                     , GBMRINFC
                     , CCHAVE
                     , IRECONC
                     , CCODMSG
                     , DATVAL
                     , COSN
                     , COSNC
                     , CREF
                     , CREFOPR
                     , CTIPREC
                     , GOBS
                     , CUSERID
                     , HTIMEST
                     , CINTERV
                     , CUSERIDINT
                 INTO
                       :SWCD7202-MRBALC
                     , :SWCD7202-MRCCB
                     , :SWCD7202-NCCCCBAN
                     , :SWCD7202-NCCCCSPAI
                     , :SWCD7202-NCCCCCONTA
                     , :SWCD7202-MRTDOC
                     , :SWCD7202-MRCOPE
                     , :SWCD7202-MRNDOC
                     , :SWCD7202-MRVLR
                     , :SWCD7202-MRSALD
                     , :SWCD7202-MRUSER
                     , :SWCD7202-MRDTSIS
                     , :SWCD7202-MRHORA
                     , :SWCD7202-MRDATL
                     , :SWCD7202-MRDRCX
                     , :SWCD7202-MRETRB
                     , :SWCD7202-MRBALM
                     , :SWCD7202-MROBS
                     , :SWCD7202-MRNOPR
                     , :SWCD7202-MRNOPS
                     , :SWCD7202-MRNORD
                     , :SWCD7202-MREANL
                     , :SWCD7202-MRDTCB
                     , :SWCD7202-MREXCT
                     , :SWCD7202-MRMOED
                     , :SWCD7202-MRDMOV
                     , :SWCD7202-GBMRINFC
                     , :SWCD7202-CCHAVE
                     , :SWCD7202-IRECONC
                     , :SWCD7202-CCODMSG
                     , :SWCD7202-DATVAL
                     , :SWCD7202-COSN
                     , :SWCD7202-COSNC
                     , :SWCD7202-CREF
                     , :SWCD7202-CREFOPR
                     , :SWCD7202-CTIPREC
                     , :SWCD7202-GOBS
                     , :SWCD7202-CUSERID
                     , :SWCD7202-HTIMEST
                     , :SWCD7202-CINTERV
                     , :SWCD7202-CUSERIDINT
                 FROM SWVT7202
                 WHERE
                    MRNOPR = :SWCD7202-MRNOPR
                     AND MRNORD = :SWCD7202-MRNORD
           END-EXEC


           MOVE CON-SWVT7202
             TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 IF VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 ELSE
                    IF NOT VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                        CONTINUE
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 IF NOT VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.


       2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.



      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5121-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5121-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5121-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
